{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16433","headline":"乌夜啼 · 刘商","name":"乌夜啼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遶树哑哑惊复栖，含烟碧树高枝齐。\n月明露湿枝亦滑，城上女墙西月低。\n愁人出户听乌啼，团团明月堕墙西。\n月中有桂树，日中有伴侣。\n何不上天去？一声啼到曙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘商","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16433.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16433","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}